+///   (Flash top → NDC y=+1, which is the top of the screen).
+/// - FBO for `render_offscreen`: dims = FBO size, origin = bounds.x_min/y_min,
+///   flip_y = false (no flip so a later `textureSample(uv.y=0)` returns the
+///   row that was Flash top — matches the convention bitmap fills already use).
+fn world_matrix_for(
+    m: &Matrix,
+    width: u32,
+    height: u32,
+    origin_x: f32,
+    origin_y: f32,
+    flip_y: bool,
